      - Alkire, S., Mishra, R. and Suppa, N. (2026). The Global Multidimensional Poverty Index (MPI) 2026: Disaggregation Results and Methodological Note. OPHI MPI Methodological Note 65, Oxford Poverty and Human Development Initiative (OPHI), University of Oxford.
